-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001","chapter_id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry","quote":"裴政"},{"mention_id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0004","paragraph_id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001","chapter_id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry","quote":"德表"},{"mention_id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p002:m0002","paragraph_id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p002","chapter_id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry","quote":"裴政"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"裴政（裴之禮子，字德表），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"vtp_lo9_0af_A","source_assertion_id":"a-liang028-zheng-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-028","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhili-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-028-peizhili-complete-ws1511902","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhili-complete:p001","quote":"子之禮，字子義，自國子生推第，補邵陵王國左常侍、信威行參軍。王爲南兗，除長流參軍，未行，仍留宿衛，補直閤將軍。丁父憂，服闋襲封，因請隨軍討壽陽，除雲麾將軍，遷散騎常侍。又別攻魏廣陵城，平之，除信武將軍、西豫州刺史，加輕車將軍，除黃門侍郎，遷中軍宣城王司馬。尋爲都督北徐仁睢三州諸軍事、信武將軍、北徐州刺史。徵太子左衛率，兼衛尉卿，轉少府卿。卒，諡曰壯。子政，承聖中，官至給事黃門侍郎。江陵陷，隨例入西魏。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhili-complete:p001:m0177","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhili-complete:p001:m0001","source_term":"子政"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"以裴之禮開傳，諡壯後接子政，與隋書相合。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998","work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","raw_mention_count":5,"mention_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p007:m0045","c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p007:m0075","c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p007:m0183","c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p007:m0265","c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p007:m0300"],"paragraph_ids":["c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p007"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p007:m00