:"vtp_lo9_0af_A","object_person_id":"vtp_lo9_0af","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"子之禮嗣","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-058","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-058-peizhili-succession","source_id":"s-nanshi-058-peizhili-succession-ws513461","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-058-peizhili-succession:p001","quote":"以為邃不死，當大辟土宇。子之禮嗣。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-058-peizhili-succession:p001:m0013","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-058-peizhili-succession:p001:m0002"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"南史在邃卒後記子之禮承嗣。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-liang028-zheng-grandfather","subject_person_id":"vtp_lo9_0af_AA","object_person_id":"vtp_lo9_0af","predicate":"grandfather","qualifiers":{"source_term":"祖邃","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-suishu","book_id":"b-suishu-066","chapter_id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry","source_id":"s-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry-ws2180374","paragraph_id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001","quote":"裴政，字德表，河東聞喜人也。高祖壽孫，從宋武帝徙家于壽陽，曆前軍長史、廬江太守。祖邃，梁侍中、左衛將軍、豫州大都督。父之禮，廷尉卿。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0041"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"隋書裴政傳具祖名，梁書稱邃之子之禮生政。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhili-complete:p001:r0056","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhili-complete:p001","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"父","person_id":"vtp_lo9_0af","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"子之禮，字子義，自國子生推第，補邵陵王國左常侍、信威行參軍。王爲南兗，除長流參軍，未行，仍留宿衛，補直閤將軍。丁父憂，服闋襲封，因請隨軍討壽陽，除雲麾將軍，遷散騎常侍。又別攻魏廣陵城，平之，除信武將軍、西豫州刺史，加輕車將軍，除黃門侍郎，遷中軍宣城王司馬。尋爲都督北徐仁睢三州諸軍事、信武將軍、北徐州刺史。徵太子左衛率，兼衛尉卿，轉少府卿。卒，諡曰壯。子政，承聖中，官至給事黃門侍郎。江陵陷，隨例入西魏。","note":"依本段敘事、稱謂及語者受者定。","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-028-peizhili-complete","book_id":"b-liangshu-028","work_id":"w-lia