太守。祖邃，梁侍中、左衛將軍、豫州大都督。父之禮，廷尉卿。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":24,"last_line":24,"raw_start":2691,"raw_end":2757,"raw_character_offsets":[2691,2692,2693,2694,2695,2696,2697,2698,2699,2700,2701,2702,2703,2704,2705,2706,2707,2708,2709,2710,2711,2712,2713,2714,2715,2716,2717,2718,2719,2720,2721,2722,2723,2724,2725,2726,2727,2728,2729,2730,2731,2732,2733,2734,2735,2736,2737,2738,2739,2740,2741,2742,2743,2744,2745,2746,2747,2748,2749,2750,2751,2752,2753,2754,2755,2756],"revision_id":2180374},"mentions":[{"id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"裴政","kind":"person","person_id":"vtp_lo9_0af_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"德表","kind":"person","person_id":"vtp_lo9_0af_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"壽孫","kind":"person","person_id":"4kt_0ar_aqo","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"邃","kind":"person","person_id":"vtp_lo9_0af","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"之禮","kind":"person","person_id":"vtp_lo9_0af_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry","book_id":"b-suishu-066","work_id":"w-suishu","source_id":"s-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry-ws2180374"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p007","text":"年三十一，襲爵華陰伯。釋褐太尉、汝南王悅騎兵參軍。揚州刺史長孫稚請為錄事參軍。蕭衍豫州刺史裴邃治合肥城，規相掩襲，密購壽春郭人李瓜花、袁建等令為內應。邃已纂勒兵士，有期日矣，而慮壽春疑覺，遂謬移云：「魏始於馬頭置戍，如聞復欲修白捺舊城。若爾，便稍相侵逼，此亦須營歐陽，設交境之備。今板卒已集，唯聽信還。」佐僚咸欲以實答之，云無修白捺意。而侃曰：「白捺小城，本非形勝。邃好小黠，今集兵遣移，虛搆是言，得無有別圖也？」稚深悟之，乃云：「錄事可造移報。」侃移曰：「彼之纂兵，想別有意，何為妄構白捺也！他人有心，予忖度之，勿謂秦無人也。」邃得移，謂已知覺，便爾散兵。瓜花等以期契不會，便相告發，伏辜者十數家。邃後竟襲壽春，入羅城而退。遂列營於黎漿、梁城，日夕鈔掠。稚乃奏侃為統軍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","source_po